# .cursorrules — universal pre-router + CAESTHETIC satellite

0. Before repo/project routing: if no active audit interview and the user mentions `Multi-Location Growth Score`, `Growth Score` or `аудит`, start the reply exactly with `Вы создаёте новый аудит? Ответьте на вопросы.` and run the manager questionnaire from root `AGENTS.md`. Do not restart an active interview.
1. Then follow root `AGENTS.md`, `START.md` and the CAESTHETIC satellite read order.
